WEBVTT

00:09:29.295 --> 00:09:32.413
Alvin and I were like parts
of the same tree.

00:09:32.437 --> 00:09:34.730
He, the roots and the trunk,

00:09:35.712 --> 00:09:37.450
and we were the branches.

00:09:37.474 --> 00:09:39.180
I was his muse.

00:09:39.609 --> 00:09:42.069
We were all his muses.

00:09:45.081 --> 00:09:47.596
The ballet "Cry,"

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:50.890
which some of you might have seen --

00:09:50.914 --> 00:09:52.882
you're going to see an excerpt of it --

00:09:52.906 --> 00:09:54.196
it was made on me,

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:56.641
and Alvin dedicated it to all black women,

00:09:56.665 --> 00:09:58.450
especially our mothers.

00:09:59.276 --> 00:10:01.257
When Alvin and I went in the studio,